{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:707a8b4b1589c00e","name":"Neuronic Whip","source":{"id":"source:reference-707a8b4b1589c00e","title":"Neuronic Whip","revision":19529,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:08:08Z","sha256":"8784fad6e16f11f45a764f4fcc33556320e72585a7a6608e68e031662cecb6ce","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19529","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Neuronic%20Whip&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-707a8b4b1589c00e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Neuronic Whip is a long, flexible cable connected to a power pack in a handle that delivers a stunning jolt on contact. Unlike a typical leather whip, the heavy cable can crack bones and break flesh, but it extremely unlikely to kill. As a result, the Neuronic Whip was very popular with slavers. A target successfully hit by a Neuronic Whip takes normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage, plus 1d4 points of Slashing damage. Additionally, a Neuronic Whip increases the wielder's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"}," by 1 square. A Neuronic Whip requires an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," to operate.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:e0213365f7fdde76"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," -\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"